#4.1 baking a cake

get ingredients 
preheat oven to 400 degrees
mix wet ingredients such as butter, eggs, sugar, and milk
and dry ingredients such as flour in with wet ingredients
grease a cake pan
pour batter into a greased cake pan
put into oven for 10 minutes
stick knife into cake
if there is no batter on knife:
    take out cake
else:
    wait 10 more minutes 


# 4.2 Fizz Buzz
# creating a "for" algorithm

i = range(1, 101)
for i in range(1, 101):
    if i % 3 ==0:
        print(i, ("fizz"))
    elif i % 5 ==0: 
        print (i, "buzz")
    if ((i % 3 == 0) and (i % 5 == 0)):
